flowchart TB
  accTitle: From open knowledge to collective discovery
  accDescr: Individual learning leads to independent inquiry and voluntary collaboration. Both paths pass through evidence, critique and revision before new knowledge returns to the commons.
  K["Open knowledge"] --> L["Individual learning and mastery"]
  L --> I["Independent inquiry"]
  L --> C["Voluntary collaboration"]
  I --> V["Evidence, critique, revision"]
  C --> V
  V --> N["New knowledge"]
  N --> K
